#. type: paragraph
#: markers.yo:1
msgid ""
"The zsh documentation delimits the description of each builtin command with "
"a pair of markers which do not enclose their section as an argument.  The "
"open and close options handle such a pair of markers."
msgstr ""
"THE ZSH DOCUMENTATION DELIMITS THE DESCRIPTION OF EACH BUILTIN COMMAND WITH "
"A PAIR OF MARKERS WHICH DO NOT ENCLOSE THEIR SECTION AS AN ARGUMENT.  THE "
"OPEN AND CLOSE OPTIONS HANDLE SUCH A PAIR OF MARKERS."

#. type: blockAstart
#: markers.yo:6
msgid "content_x"
msgstr "CONTENT_X"

#. type: blockB
#: markers.yo:10
msgid "content_y"
msgstr "CONTENT_Y"

#. type: paragraph
#: markers.yo:13
msgid ""
"After the closing marker, the text is again a plain paragraph: the blockB "
"call is not nested in the blockAstart section."
msgstr ""
"AFTER THE CLOSING MARKER, THE TEXT IS AGAIN A PLAIN PARAGRAPH: THE BLOCKB "
"CALL IS NOT NESTED IN THE BLOCKASTART SECTION."
